{"series":{"id":"strongest-upgrade","slug":"strongest-upgrade","title":"Strongest Upgrade","image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-04/tsu%2021_001_4016.png?itok=CS4xe6Tb","synopsis":"Nuestro protagonista, Zhao Fang, es arrojado a un mundo de fantasía, pero hay una trampa. Está atrapado como un joven maestro impotente y caído en desgracia, con solo una sirvienta leal a su lado. Suena duro, ¿verdad? Pero Zhao Fang no está sudando. Gracias a su profunda experiencia en juegos, rápidamente descifra el sistema, explota los fallos que rompen el juego y comienza a subir de nivel como un profesional.Con cada reino secreto que conquista, Zhao Fang desbloquea nuevas habilidades, asume locas misiones asignadas por el sistema y demuestra que no es un jugador ordinario. Está aquí para dominar el mundo del juego, una mejora a la vez.","status":"En Emisión","year":2025,"genres":[],"type":"donghua","src":"donghualife","sourceUrls":["https://donghualife.com/series/strongest-upgrade"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T18:33:42.547Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"strongest-upgrade-t1","slug":"strongest-upgrade-t1","seriesId":"strongest-upgrade","number":1,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-04/tsu%2021_001_4016.png?itok=CS4xe6Tb","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T18:33:42.547Z","episodeCount":40}],"episodes":[{"id":"strongest-upgrade-t1-e40","slug":"strongest-upgrade-t1-e40","title":"strongest-upgrade-1-episodio-x40","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/strongest-upgrade-1-episodio-x40","servers":[{"name":"rumble.com","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v6tkqwf/?pub=2y4ayp","embed":true},{"name":"geo.dailymotion.com","url":"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player.html?video=k3ZiCHDO1axjqZDncxQ","embed":true}],"seriesId":"strongest-upgrade","seasonId":"strongest-upgrade-t1","number":40,"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T18:46:25.656Z"},{"id":"strongest-upgrade-t1-e39","slug":"strongest-upgrade-t1-e39","title":"strongest-upgrade-1-episodio